
            AVH-PickMode V0.1 For DayDream BBS - Quick documentation
            ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

  What is this thing?
  ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
  AVH-PickMode is a tool to replace da anoying display-mode request from
  DayDream-BBS. It produces a small & ugly looking menu where you can
  select the displaymode using cursorkeys or by directly pressing 1-4...

  Features
  ~~~~~~~~
	- 100% DDDoor!
	- cursor movement support!
  - ugly design! ;)

  Installation
  ~~~~~~~~~~~~
	1) Copy all files from this archive to their specific directory

  2) Add following line to your DayDream:Data/FrontEnds.DAT
     --- cut here ---
     Doors:AVH-PickMode %N
     --- cut here ---
     It should be directly after AVH-BaudCheck (when installed) !!!

  Usage
  ~~~~~
